"(including dropdowns)\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t</br>*<strong>Date Greater / Date Smaller</strong> can be used "
"for all date format fields.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t</br>*Labels will not apply for taxonomy dropdowns fields. These "
"sync with the names added in Listing Submit Settings</br>"
